    "rust_first_rationale": "No standalone Python, shell, or Node validator is shipped for this declaration. This surface is owned by the Rust/Buck2 cloud-ci contract-slice-conformance gate's release-001-runtime-safety-policy slice, which pins this file's claim-ceiling, progressive-delivery, brownout, rollback, and cleanup contracts, alongside the cloud-ci rust-first and total-accounting gates.",
    "claim_boundary": "This policy remains a declaration-only RELEASE-001 safety slice and carries no live rollout execution, tenant traffic, measured SLO, runtime observability engine, or Oya CD parity/cutover claim."
